  "title": "India's Economic Performance in Q1FY27: Growth Amid Subsidies and Investment",
  "summary": "India's GDP growth in Q1FY27 was 7.8%, below the expected 8.2% GVA growth, driven by strong GDP expansion despite reduced net indirect tax growth. Investment demand surged, but consumption slowed, while agriculture and allied sectors saw a 3.6% GVA growth.",
  "facts": [
